o\":false,\"listingType\":\"sale\",\"hasBalcony\":false,\"hasGarden\":false,\"hasElevator\":false,\"hasSecurity\":false,\"hasAirConditioning\":false,\"hasPool\":false,\"petsAllowed\":false,\"rentPeriod\":\"monthly\",\"rentalHistory\":[],\"tenantRequirements\":[]},\"priceAlertEnabled\":true,\"priceAtSave\":0,\"createdAt\":\"2026-02-06T23:26:02.004Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-02-06T23:26:02.004Z\",\"__v\":0},{\"_id\":\"6986788801ec203c8fac1f7d\",\"userId\":\"693b1201442f444ce941c70f\",\"propertyId\":{\"visitAvailability\":{\"days\":[1,2,3,4,5],\"enabled\":false,\"endTime\":\"18:00\",\"slotDurationMinutes\":30,\"startTime\":\"09:00\"},\"_id\":\"6971e1dcc18c7d5d32c16607\",\"sellerId\":{\"_id\":\"696ced84235b5847d5383056\",\"email\":\"zanocodes@gmail.com\",\"name\":\"Zano Dalipi\",\"avatarUrl\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJCl6Iw4L6JJZ1oRBP_ozYEtFnkPtURtXQQ9OavvJtH4YLT-dc=s400-c\",\"role\":\"agent\",\"agencyName\":\"My Agencyy\"},\"createdByName\":\"Zano Dalipi\",\"createdByEmail\":\"zanocodes@gmail.com\",\"createdAsRole\":\"agent\",\"createdByAgencyName\":\"My Agencyy\",\"createdByLicenseNumber\":\"Zano-1111-11-1-1\",\"title\":\"Example 15\",\"status\":\"active\",\"price\":150000,\"address\":\"Ќерамидница, Гази Баба, Скопје, Општина Гази Баба, Град Скопје, 1001, Северна Македонија\",\"city\":\"Skopje\",\"country\":\"North Macedonia\",\"beds\":3,\"baths\":1,\"livingRooms\":2,\"sqft\":95,\"yearBuilt\":2025,\"parking\":1,\"description\":\"Овој прекрасен стан нуди удобност и функционалност, идеален за семеен живот во динамична средина. Со својот внимателно дизајниран ентериер и пространи простории, тој обезбедува квалитетен живот со сите потребни удобности.rnКлучни карактеристики:rn* Отворен концепт на дневна соба, кујна и трпезарија за лесно дружење и семејни активности.rn* Три пространи спални соби кои нудат приватност и удобност за сите членови на семејството.rn* Две посебни дневни зони, една интегрирана со кујната и една дополнителна, овозможувајќи флексибилност во уредувањето и користењето.rn* Модерна кујна со вградени елементи и квалитетни апарати, вклучувајќи аспиратор од нерѓосувачки челик.rn* Бања со када и посебна туш кабина, обезбедувајќи функционалност и релаксација.rn* Големи прозорци со ролетни кои овозможуваат изобилство природна светлина низ целиот стан.rn* Балкон или надворешен простор достапен од дневната зона, идеален за утринско кафе или релаксација.rnМатеријали и конструкција:rn* Квалитетни керамички плочки во отворениот простор на кујната/трпезаријата и во бањата.rn* Удобен тепих во спалните и едната дневна соба, додавајќи топлина.rn* Дрвени акценти и мебел, вклучувајќи маси и ноќни масички, кои придонесуваат за пријатна атмосфера.rn* Ѕидови обоени во неутрални и земјени тонови, лесни за персонализација.rn* Прозорци со дрвени венецијанер ролетни обезбедуваат приватност и контрола на светлината.rn* Стаклена туш кабина во бањата.\",\"specialFeatures\":[\"balcony\",\"Open-plan living, kitchen, and dining area\",\"Three spacious bedrooms\",\"Two distinct living zones\",\"Modern kitchen with stainless steel range hood\",\"Bathroom with separate shower and bathtub\",\"Abundant natural light through large windows\",\"Wooden Venetian blinds throughout\"],\"materials\":[\"ceramic tiles\",\"carpet\",\"wood\",\"upholstered furniture\",\"stainless steel\",\"glass\",\"painted walls\"],\"hasVirtualTour360\":false,\"imageUrl\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1769071054/balkan-estate/users/696ced84235b5847d5383056/listings/temp/dllfvf0wfbxtso5m3oom.jpg\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1769071054/balkan-estate/users/696ced84235b5847d5383056/listings/temp/dllfvf0wfbxtso5m3oom.jpg\",\"publicId\":\"balkan-estate/users/696ced84235b5847d5383056/listings/temp/dllfvf0wfbxtso5m3oom\",\"tag\":\"living_room\",\"_id\":\"6971e1dcc18c7d5d32c16608\"},{\"url\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1769071055/balkan-estate/users/696ced84235b5847d5383056/listings/temp/noq7tyjsardvf76ovynh.jpg\",\"publicId\":\"balkan-estate/users/696ced84235b5847d5383056/listings/temp/noq7tyjsardvf76ovynh\",\"tag\":\"bedroom\",\"_id\":\"6971e1dcc18c7d5d32c16609\"},{\"url\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1769071056/balkan-estate/users/696ced84235b5847d5383056/listings/temp/tjdiklmhsx2d2slrvday.jpg\",\"publicId\":\"balkan-estate/users/696ced84235b5847d5383056/listings/temp/tjdiklmhsx2d2slrvday\",\"tag\":\"bathroom\",\"_id\":\"6971e1dcc18c7d5d32c1660a\"},{\"url\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1769071058/balkan-estate/users/696ced84235b5847d5383056/listings/temp/ajsrygotokssaqv5lwuc.jpg\",\"publicId\":\"balkan-estate/users/696ced84235b5847d5383056/listings/temp/ajsrygotokssaqv5lwuc\",\"tag\":\"bedroom\",\"_id\":\"6971e1dcc18c7d5d32c1660b\"},{\"url\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1769071060/balkan-estate/users/696ced84235b5847d5383056/listings/temp/vsqs8gzfvj3v3lg3xxfn.jpg\",\"publicId\":\"balkan-estate/users/696ced84235b5847d5383056/listings/temp/vsqs8gzfvj3v3lg3xxfn\",\"tag\":\"living_room\",\"_id\":\"6971e1dcc18c7d5d32c1660c\"},{\"url\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1769071061/balkan-estate/users/696ced84235b5847d5383056/listings/temp/whx4kff8soeb48zc7gja.jpg\",\"publicId\":\"balkan-estate/users/696ced84235b5847d5383056/listings/temp/whx4kff8soeb48zc7gja\",\"tag\":\"bedroom\",\"_id\":\"6971e1dcc18c7d5d32c1660d\"}],\"lat\":41.99753053704204,\"lng\":21.455563960743497,\"propertyType\":\"apartment\",\"floorNumber\":8,\"views\":93,\"saves\":5,\"inquiries\":0,\"isPromoted\":false,\"hasUrgentBadge\":false,\"amenities\":[],\"hasBalcony\":true,\"hasSecurity\":true,\"distanceToCenter\":3.1,\"distanceToSchool\":0.8,\"distanceToHospital\":4.7,\"furnishing\":\"semi-furnished\",\"heatingType\":\"central\",\"condition\":\"new\",\"viewType\":\"city\",\"energyRating\":\"A+\",\"priceIntervals\":[],\"lastRenewed\":\"2026-01-22T08:37:48.080Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-22T08:37:48.083Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-02-15T00:02:41.618Z\",\"__v\":3,\"hasGeneratedVideo\":false,\"listingType\":\"sale\",\"rentPeriod\":\"monthly\",\"tenantRequirements\":[],\"hasGarden\":false,\"hasElevator\":false,\"hasAirConditioning\":false,\"hasPool\":false,\"petsAllowed\":false,\"rentalHistory\":[]},\"priceAlertEnabled\":true,\"priceAtSave\":0,\"createdAt\":\"2026-02-06T23:26:00.136Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-02-06T23:26:00.136Z\",\"__v\":0},{\"_id\":\"69790d6db938887600d6dd56\",\"userId\":\"693b1201442f444ce941c70f\",\"propertyId\":{\"visitAvailability\":{\"days\":[1,2,3,4,5],\"enabled\":false,\"endTime\":\"18:00\",\"slotDurationMinutes\":30,\"startTime\":\"09:00\"},\"_id\":\"69769be6618d8ce12db9ed62\",\"sellerId\":{\"_id\":\"693b1201442f444ce941c70f\",\"email\":\"agent1@agent.com\",\"name\":\"agent1\",\"phone\":\"+389 71 111 111\",\"role\":\"agent\",\"agencyName\":\"Horizon Property Group (agent 1)\"},\"createdByName\":\"agent1\",\"createdByEmail\":\"agent1@agent.com\",\"createdAsRole\":\"private_seller\",\"title\":\"Example 12\",\"status\":\"active\",\"price\":1500000,\"address\":\"AC Hotel by Marriott Split, 61A, Ulica Domovinskog rata, Gradski kotar Ravne njive, Split, Grad Split, Splitsko-dalmatinska županija, 21000, Hrvatska\",\"city\":\"Split\",\"country\":\"Croatia\",\"beds\":3,\"baths\":2,\"livingRooms\":2,\"sqft\":100,\"yearBuilt\":2023,\"parking\":0,\"description\":\"Predstavljamo vam izniman moderni apartman smješten na atraktivnoj lokaciji na Balkanu, koji nudi savršen spoj luksuza, udobnosti i spektakularnog pogleda. Ovaj elegantno dizajniran dom idealan je za one koji traže suvremeni životni prostor s otvorenim tlocrtom i obiljem prirodnog svjetla. Velike staklene površine pružaju prekrasne panoramske poglede na more i okolno zelenilo, stvarajući opuštajuću atmosferu u svakom kutku. Apartman je opremljen najkvalitetnijim materijalima i suvremenom opremom, što ga čini spremnim za useljenje bez dodatnih ulaganja. Ključne Značajke: * Prostrani otvoreni tlocrt koji spaja dnevni boravak, blagovaonicu i kuhinju, osiguravajući prozračnost i funkcionalnost. * Staklene stijene od poda do stropa s izlazom na prostrani balkon/terasu, nudeći neometane panoramske poglede na more i krajolik. * Moderna kuhinja s otokom, opremljena integriranim vrhunskim aparatima i elegantnim mramornim radnim pločama. * Kvalitetni završni materijali, uključujući svijetle keramičke pločice i drvene elemente, doprinoseći sofisticiranom izgledu. * Suvremeni minimalistički dizajn interijera, s pažljivo odabranim detaljima i neutralnim paletama boja. * Dva odvojena dnevna boravka, pružajući fleksibilnost i dodatni prostor za opuštanje ili rad. Materijali i Konstrukcija: * Podovi obloženi visokokvalitetnim keramičkim pločicama u svijetlim nijansama, koje imitiraju kamen ili drvo. * Mramorne površine korištene na kuhinjskom otoku, dodajući element luksuza i izdržljivosti. * Zidovi pretežno obojani u bijelo s elegantnim sivim naglascima, stvarajući modernu i svježu estetiku. * Vanjska stolarija od velikih staklenih panela osigurava maksimalan prodor svjetlosti i izvrsnu toplinsku izolaciju. * Kuhinjski elementi izrađeni od kombinacije drva i medijapana s modernim, glatkim frontama. * Integrirana stropna rasvjeta i stropni ventilatori za optimalnu udobnost i funkcionalnost.\",\"specialFeatures\":[\"Balkon/terasa\",\"Stropni ventilator\",\"Ugradbeni kuhinjski aparati\",\"Panoramski pogled\",\"Prostrani otvoreni tlocrt\",\"Staklene stijene od poda do stropa\",\"Moderna kuhinja s otokom\",\"Kvalitetni završni materijali\",\"Suvremeni minimalistički dizajn\",\"Dva odvojena dnevna boravka\"],\"materials\":[\"Keramičke pločice\",\"Mramor\",\"Obojani zidovi\",\"Staklo\",\"Nehrđajući čelik\",\"Drvo\"],\"tourUrl\":\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DHW9kpxP9An/?utm_source=ig_web_button_share_sheet\",\"hasVirtualTour360\":false,\"imageUrl\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1769380822/balkan-estate/users/693b1201442f444ce941c70f/listings/temp/rib9wpxbgtdrirbt5ein.jpg\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1769380822/balkan-estate/users/693b1201442f444ce941c70f/listings/temp/rib9wpxbgtdrirbt5ein.jpg\",\"tag\":\"living_room\",\"_id\":\"6977ed96ae05f6696bb72e92\"},{\"url\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1769380824/balkan-estate/users/693b1201442f444ce941c70f/listings/temp/iiojeakickx6whrhvmx2.jpg\",\"tag\":\"living_room\",\"_id\":\"6977ed96ae05f6696bb72e93\"},{\"url\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1769380826/balkan-estate/users/693b1201442f444ce941c70f/listings/temp/jge4i8hdheuyiu5zngk5.jpg\",\"tag\":\"kitchen\",\"_id\":\"6977ed96ae05f6696bb72e94\"},{\"url\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1769380828/balkan-estate/users/693b1201442f444ce941c70f/listings/temp/qtrfmpfdgtjky1niaq02.jpg\",\"tag\":\"living_room\",\"_id\":\"6977ed96ae05f6696bb72e95\"},{\"url\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1769380829/balkan-estate/users/693b1201442f444ce941c70f/listings/temp/v1spcljfieypxo3kn6ek.jpg\",\"tag\":\"living_room\",\"_id\":\"6977ed96ae05f6696bb72e96\"}],\"lat\":43.520300417865705,\"lng\":16.45084083080292,\"propertyType\":\"apartment\",\"floorNumber\":18,\"totalFloors\":28,\"views\":38,\"saves\":1,\"inquiries\":0,\"isPromoted\":false,\"hasUrgentBadge\":false,\"amenities\":[],\"distanceToCenter\":3,\"distanceToSea\":2,\"distanceToSchool\":0.7,\"distanceToHospital\":2.5,\"priceIntervals\":[],\"lastRenewed\":\"2026-02-06T23:22:45.723Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-25T22:40:38.782Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-02-13T20:04:35.279Z\",\"__v\":2,\"hasGeneratedVideo\":false,\"listingType\":\"sale\",\"hasBalcony\":false,\"hasGarden\":false,\"hasElevator\":false,\"hasSecurity\":false,\"hasAirConditioning\":false,\"hasPool\":false,\"petsAllowed\":false,\"rentPeriod\":\"monthly\",\"rentalHistory\":[],\"tenantRequirements\":[]},\"priceAlertEnabled\":true,\"priceAtSave\":0,\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-27T19:09:33.576Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-01-27T19:09:33.576Z\",\"__v\":0},{\"_id\":\"69790d6bb938887600d6dc6e\",\"userId\":\"693b1201442f444ce941c70f\",\"propertyId\":{\"visitAvailability\":{\"days\":[1,2,3,4,5],\"enabled\":false,\"endTime\":\"18:00\",\"slotDurationMinutes\":30,\"startTime\":\"09:00\"},\"_id\":\"6977efc2ae05f6696bb7368b\",\"sellerId\":{\"_id\":\"693b1201442f444ce941c70f\",\"email\":\"agent1@agent.com\",\"name\":\"agent1\",\"phone\":\"+389 71 111 111\",\"role\":\"agent\",\"agencyName\":\"Horizon Property Group (agent 1)\"},\"createdByName\":\"agent1\",\"createdByEmail\":\"agent1@agent.com\",\"createdAsRole\":\"private_seller\",\"title\":\"Example 11\",\"status\":\"active\",\"price\":400000,\"address\":\"Dalmatia Tower, 61A, Ulica Domovinskog rata, Gradski kotar Ravne njive, Split, Grad Split, Splitsko-dalmatinska županija, 21000, Hrvatska\",\"city\":\"Split\",\"country\":\"Croatia\",\"beds\":0,\"baths\":0,\"livingRooms\":0,\"sqft\":100,\"yearBuilt\":2015,\"parking\":0,\"description\":\"Uronite u svijet luksuza i sofisticiranosti s ovim iznimnim apartmanom smještenim u srcu urbanog pejzaža, unutar ikoničnog nebodera koji dominira horizontom. Ovaj moderni dom nudi ne samo vrhunski životni prostor već i pristup ekskluzivnim sadržajima koji osiguravaju udobnost i prestiž. S panoramskim pogledom na grad i more, svaki dan postaje iskustvo neusporedive ljepote i mira, idealno za one koji traže urbanu oazu s daškom glamura. Ključne značajke: - Panoramski pogled na grad i more iz visokog kata- Pristup luksuznom unutarnjem bazenu s ležaljkama- Veličanstveno predvorje s impozantnim stubištem i recepcijom- Moderan dizajn zgrade i interijera, simbol prestiža Materijali i izgradnja: - Fasada od stakla i visokokvalitetnih kompozitnih materijala- Interijeri zajedničkih prostora obloženi kamenom (stubište, podovi) i drvenim panelima- Elegantna rasvjetna tijela i dizajnerski namještaj u zajedničkim prostorima- Korištenje premium materijala za dugotrajnost i estetiku\",\"specialFeatures\":[\"unutarnji bazen\",\"luksuzno predvorje\",\"panoramski pogled\",\"Panoramski pogled na grad i more\",\"Pristup luksuznom unutarnjem bazenu\",\"Veličanstveno predvorje s recepcijom\",\"Moderan dizajn i prestižna lokacija\"],\"materials\":[\"staklena fasada\",\"kameni podovi\",\"drveni paneli\",\"dizajnerska rasvjeta\",\"moderni kompozitni materijali\"],\"tourUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zcSMh8pMpPI\",\"hasVirtualTour360\":false,\"imageUrl\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1769467831/balkan-estate/users/693b1201442f444ce941c70f/listings/temp/rbdmvhvwmecpot7oxtwh.jpg\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1769467831/balkan-estate/users/693b1201442f444ce941c70f/listings/temp/rbdmvhvwmecpot7oxtwh.jpg\",\"publicId\":\"balkan-estate/users/693b1201442f444ce941c70f/listings/temp/rbdmvhvwmecpot7oxtwh\",\"tag\":\"other\",\"_id\":\"6977efc2ae05f6696bb7368c\"},{\"url\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1769467833/balkan-estate/users/693b1201442f444ce941c70f/listings/temp/hatod0mi41vcl36kf8mf.jpg\",\"publicId\":\"balkan-estate/users/693b1201442f444ce941c70f/listings/temp/hatod0mi41vcl36kf8mf\",\"tag\":\"other\",\"_id\":\"6977efc2ae05f6696bb7368d\"},{\"url\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1769467834/balkan-estate/users/693b1201442f444ce941c70f/listings/temp/wmbv2yq5csnnkzzd9bll.jpg\",\"publicId\":\"balkan-estate/users/693b1201442f444ce941c70f/listings/temp/wmbv2yq5csnnkzzd9bll\",\"tag\":\"exterior\",\"_id\":\"6977efc2ae05f6696bb7368e\"}],\"lat\":43.5203328,\"lng\":16.4508911,\"propertyType\":\"apartment\",\"floorNumber\":28,\"totalFloors\":28,\"views\":15,\"saves\":2,\"inquiries\":0,\"isPromoted\":true,\"hasUrgentBadge\":false,\"amenities\":[],\"hasBalcony\":true,\"hasGarden\":true,\"hasElevator\":true,\"hasSecurity\":true,\"hasAirConditioning\":true,\"hasPool\":true,\"petsAllowed\":true,\"distanceToCenter\":2.7,\"distanceToSea\":1.5,\"distanceToSchool\":0.5,\"distanceToHospital\":3.2,\"furnishing\":\"semi-furnished\",\"heatingType\":\"electric\",\"condition\":\"excellent\",\"viewType\":\"sea\",\"energyRating\":\"A+\",\"priceIntervals\":[],\"lastRenewed\":\"2026-02-06T23:20:55.370Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-26T22:50:42.148Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-02-15T00:02:40.581Z\",\"__v\":1,\"hasGeneratedVideo\":false,\"promotionEndDate\":\"2026-03-08T23:19:28.127Z\",\"promotionStartDate\":\"2026-02-06T23:19:28.127Z\",\"promotionTier\":\"featured\",\"listingType\":\"sale\",\"rentPeriod\":\"monthly\",\"rentalHistory\":[],\"tenantRequirements\":[]},\"priceAlertEnabled\":true,\"priceAtSave\":0,\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-27T19:09:31.998Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-01-27T19:09:31.998Z\",\"__v\":0},{\"priceAlertEnabled\":true,\"priceAtSave\":0,\"_id\":\"694057dae7016ed0eb7cd7b9\",\"userId\":\"693b1201442f444ce941c70f\",\"propertyId\":{\"visitAvailability\":{\"enabled\":false,\"days\":[1,2,3,4,5],\"startTime\":\"09:00\",\"endTime\":\"18:00\",\"slotDurationMinutes\":30},\"rentPeriod\":\"monthly\",\"tenantRequirements\":[],\"_id\":\"694055e4e7016ed0eb7cd6ce\",\"sellerId\":{\"_id\":\"693ddce513c66e2728876a6f\",\"email\":\"agent5@agent.com\",\"name\":\"agent5\",\"phone\":\"071967915\",\"role\":\"agent\",\"agencyName\":\"Independent Agent\"},\"createdByName\":\"agent5\",\"createdByEmail\":\"agent5@agent.com\",\"title\":\"Great Apartment with lake view\",\"status\":\"sold\",\"price\":1211111,\"address\":\"Буковик, Општина Аранђеловац, Шумадијски управни округ, Централна Србија, 34300, Србија\",\"city\":\"Arandelovac\",\"country\":\"Serbia\",\"beds\":2,\"baths\":1,\"livingRooms\":4,\"sqft\":220,\"yearBuilt\":2015,\"parking\":4,\"description\":\"Predstavljamo Vam modernu vilu sa savremenim dizajnom, smeštenu u mirnom i uređenom stambenom okruženju. Ova nekretnina nudi idealnu kombinaciju udobnosti i funkcionalnosti, pružajući savršen dom za porodični život. Sa prostranim eksterijerom i promišljenim detaljima, ova vila je dizajnirana da ispuni sve potrebe savremenog stanovanja, obezbeđujući privatnost i komfor.\\n\\nKey Features:\\n- Moderan arhitektonski stil sa čistim linijama i estetikom.\\n- Prostrana okućnica sa negovanim travnjakom, idealna za opuštanje i dečiju igru.\\n- Dvostruka ugrađena garaža koja pruža siguran parking i dodatni skladišni prostor.\\n- Veliki prozori koji osiguravaju izobilje prirodne svetlosti u unutrašnjosti (iako unutrašnjost nije prikazana).\\n- Nalazi se u uređenom i mirnom stambenom naselju, što garantuje prijatan životni ambijent.\\n\\nMaterials & Construction:\\n- Fasada od svetlih cigli, pružajući moderan i robustan izgled.\\n- Tamni metalni krov, doprinoseći savremenoj estetici i dugotrajnosti.\\n- Betonski prilaz i trotoari, obezbeđujući praktičnost i trajnost.\\n- Stolarija sa tamnim ramovima, verovatno PVC ili aluminijumska, usklađena sa modernim dizajnom.\",\"specialFeatures\":[\"Garaža\",\"Dvorište\",\"Moderan dizajn eksterijera\",\"Uređeno prednje dvorište\",\"Dvostruka garaža\",\"Obilje prirodnog svetla (pretpostavljeno po velikim prozorima)\"],\"materials\":[\"Fasada od cigle\",\"Metalni krov\",\"Betonski prilaz\",\"Stakleni prozori\"],\"tourUrl\":\"\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1765823967/balkan-estate/property/user-693ddce513c66e2728876a6f/temp/vmikhkfeveibibteonjg.jpg\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1765823967/balkan-estate/property/user-693ddce513c66e2728876a6f/temp/vmikhkfeveibibteonjg.jpg\",\"publicId\":\"balkan-estate/property/user-693ddce513c66e2728876a6f/temp/vmikhkfeveibibteonjg\",\"tag\":\"exterior\",\"_id\":\"694055e4e7016ed0eb7cd6cf\"}],\"lat\":44.3296811,\"lng\":20.5177402,\"propertyType\":\"villa\",\"totalFloors\":1,\"views\":0,\"saves\":1,\"inquiries\":0,\"isPromoted\":false,\"hasUrgentBadge\":false,\"amenities\":[],\"hasBalcony\":true,\"hasGarden\":true,\"distanceToCenter\":6.5,\"distanceToSchool\":1.2,\"distanceToHospital\":7,\"furnishing\":\"unfurnished\",\"heatingType\":\"solar\",