"city\":\"Struga\",\"country\":\"North Macedonia\",\"beds\":1,\"baths\":2,\"livingRooms\":1,\"sqft\":150,\"yearBuilt\":2018,\"parking\":1,\"description\":\"Discover this exquisite modern house boasting a sophisticated open-plan design, perfectly blending functionality with contemporary style. The heart of the home is undoubtedly this pristine kitchen, flowing seamlessly into a welcoming living area, ideal for both daily living and entertaining. Every detail has been carefully considered to create a bright, inviting, and highly practical living space in the vibrant Balkan region.Key Features: State-of-the-art kitchen with integrated appliances and ample storage. Spacious kitchen island providing additional counter space and informal dining. Open-concept layout connecting kitchen to a comfortable living room area. Energy-efficient air conditioning unit for year-round comfort. Stylish gold-finish hardware on cabinetry adds a touch of luxury.Materials & Construction: Durable wood-look laminate flooring throughout the main living areas. Sleek white lacquered cabinetry offering a clean, minimalist aesthetic. Hard-wearing quartz or similar stone countertops for high functionality. Modern white ceramic subway tile backsplash. Integrated stainless steel oven and microwave appliances. Contemporary linear pendant lighting over the kitchen island.\",\"specialFeatures\":[\"air conditioning\",\"Modern kitchen design\",\"Integrated ovens and microwave\",\"Large kitchen island with seating\",\"Induction cooktop\",\"Contemporary light fixtures\",\"Open concept living area\",\"Gold-finish hardware\"],\"materials\":[\"Wood-look laminate flooring\",\"White lacquered cabinetry\",\"Quartz countertops\",\"Ceramic wall tiles\",\"Gold-finish hardware\",\"Stainless steel appliances\",\"White painted walls\"],\"tourUrl\":\"\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1766150784/balkan-estate/property/user-69454279e1089f2b2b9062f9/temp/sylej1n93wqcsc9wsmcz.jpg\",\"image