          "cookies": [],
          "content": {
            "size": 188033,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"properties\":[{\"visitAvailability\":{\"days\":[1,2,3,4,5],\"enabled\":false,\"endTime\":\"18:00\",\"slotDurationMinutes\":30,\"startTime\":\"09:00\"},\"_id\":\"6985f6c1e0e963c98bb525fc\",\"sellerId\":{\"_id\":\"693ddce513c66e2728876a6f\",\"email\":\"agent5@agent.com\",\"name\":\"agent5\",\"phone\":\"071967915\",\"role\":\"agent\",\"agencyName\":\"Independent Agent\"},\"createdByName\":\"agent5\",\"createdByEmail\":\"agent5@agent.com\",\"createdAsRole\":\"agent\",\"createdByAgencyName\":\"Independent Agent\",\"createdByLicenseNumber\":\"Agent-5-555\",\"title\":\"Example 6\",\"status\":\"active\",\"price\":4000000,\"address\":\"Ресенски сарај, 29. Ноември, Ресен, Општина Ресен, 7310, Северна Македонија\",\"city\":\"Resen\",\"country\":\"North Macedonia\",\"beds\":6,\"baths\":4,\"livingRooms\":5,\"sqft\":3000,\"yearBuilt\":1800,\"parking\":5,\"description\":\"Saraj\\nSaraj is a municipality located on the western edge of Skopje, blending suburban living with natural surroundings. It is known for its proximity to Matka Canyon, the Treska River, and surrounding mountains, making it attractive for people who want quick access to nature while staying close to the capital. Saraj has been developing rapidly in recent years, especially in residential housing, and is popular among families seeking quieter living near Skopje.\\nResen\\nResen is a small town in southwestern North Macedonia, situated near Lake Prespa and surrounded by apple orchards and mountains. It is best known for its agricultural heritage, especially apple production, and for its calm, scenic environment. Resen offers a slower pace of life, clean air, and strong connections to nature, making it appealing for those who prefer rural charm and a peaceful lifestyle.\\nIf you want this shorter, more marketing-style, or written for a real estate app / tourism page, tell me the context and I’ll tailor it perfectly.\",\"specialFeatures\":[],\"materials\":[],\"tourUrl\":\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DKMzptns1cg/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&igsh=MzRlODBiNWFlZA==\",\"virtualTour360Url\":\"https://z360-virtual-tour.vercel.app/embed/Saraj\",\"hasVirtualTour360\":true,\"hasGeneratedVideo\":false,\"imageUrl\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1770387109/balkan-estate/users/693ddce513c66e2728876a6f/listings/temp/qg7mdspazaj39fqurjti.jpg\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1770387109/balkan-estate/users/693ddce513c66e2728876a6f/listings/temp/qg7mdspazaj39fqurjti.jpg\",\"publicId\":\"balkan-estate/users/693ddce513c66e2728876a6f/listings/temp/qg7mdspazaj39fqurjti\",\"tag\":\"other\",\"_id\":\"6985f6c1e0e963c98bb525fd\"},{\"url\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1770387112/balkan-estate/users/693ddce513c66e2728876a6f/listings/temp/x4njhj8ggjczkaoxcnqi.jpg\",\"publicId\":\"balkan-estate/users/693ddce513c66e2728876a6f/listings/temp/x4njhj8ggjczkaoxcnqi\",\"tag\":\"other\",\"_id\":\"6985f6c1e0e963c98bb525fe\"},{\"url\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1770387115/balkan-estate/users/693ddce513c66e2728876a6f/listings/temp/sfxb61jncerjuv6phnjv.jpg\",\"publicId\":\"balkan-estate/users/693ddce513c66e2728876a6f/listings/temp/sfxb61jncerjuv6phnjv\",\"tag\":\"other\",\"_id\":\"6985f6c1e0e963c98bb525ff\"},{\"url\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1770387117/balkan-estate/users/693ddce513c66e2728876a6f/listings/temp/y3ywfoeflqarq6b0fwpd.jpg\",\"publicId\":\"balkan-estate/users/693ddce513c66e2728876a6f/listings/temp/y3ywfoeflqarq6b0fwpd\",\"tag\":\"other\",\"_id\":\"6985f6c1e0e963c98bb52600\"},{\"url\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/upload/v1770387121/balkan-estate/users/693ddce513c66e2728876a6f/listings/temp/vtell3aj9ozbaohr77sp.jpg\",\"publicId\":\"balkan-estate/users/693ddce513c66e2728876a6f/listings/temp/vtell3aj9ozbaohr77sp\",\"tag\":\"other\",\"_id\":\"6985f6c1e0e963c98bb52601\"},{\"url\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dh8tbq8wy/image/uploa